Data notice

The MIT License above covers the code only. The files in data/ contain public
announcements that game developers posted on their Steam community pages,
collected through the public Steam Web API (ISteamNews/GetNewsForApp). The text
remains the property of the respective developers and publishers. It is shared
here unchanged in substance, for non-commercial research and teaching only, and
every row keeps the Steam app id and announcement id (gid) so it can be traced to
its source (https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/<appid>). No player or user
data is collected. If you are a rights holder and want a game's announcements
removed, open an issue.
